          140 applications. 3 replies.<br />
          Then Arjun joined
          <span style="color:#DA0007">tribera</span>.
        </h2>

        <p id="signalSubtext" class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-black/50">
          One advisor interview created a verified profile that reached serious teams already hiring for his stack.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        id="signalGrid"
        style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2px;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden"
      >
        <div class="signalCard" style="background:#f0f0f0;padding:52px 48px;position:relative">
